# ---------- Character inventory (NOT for public release) ----------
# The ancient_3500 inventory is an internal research asset.
# It ships embedded inside the compiled release - packed and compressed by
# tools/pack_inventory.py into build_data/char_inventory.bin - but the raw
# table is deliberately excluded from this repository. See README.md.
data/char_inventory.csv

# build staging directory (holds the packed inventory)
build_data/

# ---------- Output samples that print character grades ----------
# docs/demo_output.txt is a real run of the tool: it prints the grade (A-E) of
# twenty individual characters, which is inventory content, plus the full set
# of metric values for that poem. Kept locally as a sample; not tracked.
docs/demo_output.txt

# ---------- Unpublished research results (embargoed until the paper is out) --
# These files carry results that have not been published yet: per-poem metric
# values, the frozen band assignment, the source of every reference text, and
# the Section 4.6 robustness re-weighting. They stay on disk so the local
# regression scripts keep working, but they are deliberately not tracked -
# `git add -A` must never pick them up again, because this repository was
# public once and may be published again after the embargo.
# Removed from the index on 2026-09-26; see docs/takedown_request.md.
data/corpus_frozen.csv
data/poems_82_text.csv
data/titles_82.tsv
docs/corpus_provenance.md
docs/regression_82.txt
docs/robustness.md
docs/robustness_82.csv
docs/robustness_82.txt

# ---------- Manuscript cross-check ----------
# docs/paper_alignment_check.md quotes the manuscript's own Table 5 statistics
# and Table 6 rho values, which are unpublished. Local working note only.
docs/paper_alignment_check.md
